• [ SHIFT ]    : DEFLECTOR SHIELD (5-SECOND BARRIER, 12s RECHARGE)
• [ E ]        : SCREEN BURST SMART BOMB (CLEAR ALL OBSTACLES & BULLETS)
• [ ESC / P ]  : TACTICAL PAUSE & AUDIO CONFIGURATION"

